                                    <pre><code class="recipe-code"></code></pre>
                                </details>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="credit">
                    Rosette Garden 03 is a fixed, hand-composed SVG rather than
                    generator output. It adapts selected contours from <em>Four
                    Ornamental Rosette Designs</em> (A. Panier, Cooper
