                    <h2 id="mg-generator">The version-1 generator, in your browser.</h2>
                    <p>
                        <code>geometry.py</code>, <code>config.py</code> and <code>svg.py</code> (version
                        1.0.0) ported to
                        JavaScript, with the same parameter ranges and the
                        same validation messages. With the default recipe it
