                            <li>Artistically approved final pages</li>
                            <li>Physical test prints of the latest candidates</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="case-section skills-section" aria-labelledby="mg-skills">
                <div class="section-heading centered-heading">
                    <p class="eyebrow">07 — Skills demonstrated</p>
                    <h2 id="mg-skills">Geometry you can print and reproduce.</h2>
